<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>VIP Status Expired</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .header {
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 3px solid #0066cc;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #0066cc;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .highlight {
      color: #0066cc;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h2>VIP Status Expired</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Dear {{companyName}},</p>

    <p>We're writing to inform you that the VIP status for your job posting <span class="highlight">{{jobTitle}}</span>
      has expired.</p>

    <p>What this means:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your job posting will now appear in the standard job listings</li>
      <li>It will no longer have priority placement in search results</li>
      <li>It will no longer be featured in the VIP jobs section</li>
    </ul>

    <p>To restore VIP status and maximize your job posting's visibility:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Visit your job dashboard</li>
      <li>Select the job posting</li>
      <li>Choose the "Upgrade to VIP" option</li>
    </ul>

    <p>VIP job postings receive significantly more views and applications!</p>

    <p style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="button">View Job Dashboard</a>
    </p>

    <p>Thank you for using our platform for your recruitment needs.</p>

    <p>Best regards,<br>
      The F Career Connect Team</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply directly to this email.</p>
    <p>&copy; 2024 F Career Connect. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</body>

</html>
